# Summary

The statute specifies that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute[[cite:obs-97843adcd4bfdc261d6ddfc8037a2d4a01c84e44 "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]. According to the schedule, ledgers are kept for eleven calendar years and then shredded[[cite:obs-b81514ecc6784696fdf05adab690ba4cb8a64c49 "Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards."]].
